        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >London: Echoes of The Past is a short yuri mystery visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious woman returns back from the dead, and the dusty past surfaces. Between a gloomy school girl and a glamorous ex-girlfriend,  every clue interwines. Who is the mastermind behind the scene? Play as a detective heroine in 1935 London, embark on a journey of love and growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/952d97ed7f3187e5a75d0a6989034b66.avif?t=1785366995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras_big/952d97ed7f3187e5a75d0a6989034b66.avif?t=1785366995 width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm, intelligent private detective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An agent with a secret mission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Could it be that every reunions is just another deadly gamble elaborated by the fate?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/f2cf2a6dbb74e78669f410d1b1640271.avif?t=1785366995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras_big/f2cf2a6dbb74e78669f410d1b1640271.avif?t=1785366995 width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stubborn, lively young girl with a strange obsession with He Yaqiong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A student client who awaked the dusty memory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“It's hard to say, things are unpredictable, some things always change. Don't you think so?”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/291411c19652a17b1ebe8285a07882dc.avif?t=1785366995\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras_big/291411c19652a17b1ebe8285a07882dc.avif?t=1785366995 width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle, elegant, glamorous and mysterious ex-girlfriend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified international businesswoman</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I've often wondered what kind of person you would become, Ya. Thank you for giving me the answer.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre Commissions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost and Found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tangible riddles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts of the past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A foreign land, an old friend, a strange case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the connection among them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a time for justice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bullet takes flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you pierce through the fog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the truth?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuri Mystery Visual Novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90,000 Words</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cel Shading Backgrounds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ CGs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perspectives of the gentle Queenie and the brooding Xin Rui are now for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these newly unlocked narrative branches, you will re-experience the established storylinbe through their first-person viewpoints. Step back into the familiar path of events and choices, but this time, you will capture the unspoken emotional undercurrents that once flowed beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the silent conflict within Queenie—the constant weighing of reason and struggle hidden behind her soft exterior. Confront the long-suppressed solitude and obsession deep within Xin Rui’s heart. The buried thoughts and fleeting trembles of emotion that remained hidden in the main storyline will now, one by one, come to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※ How to unlock:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon completing a specific character route, their &quot;Omniscient Perspective&quot; will be made available. Following the ending and the final credits, a system prompt will appear asking if you wish to enter this perspective. Simply select &quot;Confirm&quot; to begin the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/1bfd9747a81c0d510c8f571955d85c6b.avif?t=1785366995\" width=1200 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides, our game includes a short extra story on time travel of about 20,000 words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The extra story is set in Iceland 1980, where the characters travel to the future and bump into another side of destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this part of the story, you will unlock the elderly images of the characters as time goes by, and witness an extended version of their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/0a627ff5c34380951a1bd690ec4a52a1.avif?t=1785366995\" width=1200 height=594 /></span></p>",
